WEBVTT

00:00:00.176 --> 00:00:02.376
Hey, can someone take a look at
the export queue?

00:00:02.938 --> 00:00:03.773
I added retries.

00:00:04.287 --> 00:00:06.872
Six lines, thought I'd be out of
here in five minutes.

00:00:07.241 --> 00:00:08.975
Now I've got nine jobs from one click.

00:00:09.489 --> 00:00:10.244
There are 12 now.

00:00:10.629 --> 00:00:11.303
It's still going up!

00:00:11.994 --> 00:00:15.382
And before you ask, no, I didn't sit
there clicking the button.

00:00:16.008 --> 00:00:17.678
I clicked once and went to get water.

00:00:18.015 --> 00:00:22.350
The page says it failed, but something's
definitely running because the servers are

00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:22.993
getting hammered.

00:00:23.571 --> 00:00:25.144
I'll put the job numbers in the chat.

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:27.542
Can you check what's still running
after the timeout?

00:00:27.816 --> 00:00:30.908
I think I've made the same problem
happen faster, so that's nice.

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:32.985
I was about to close my laptop too.

00:00:33.709 --> 00:00:34.772
Apparently we're doing this now.

